          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At Samantha Hall Designs, being responsible towards the environment isn't just a trend, it's been woven into the fabric of our business since our founding in 2017. As a female-owned micro business operating from a home office, we're committed to the triple bottom line of People, Planet and Profit, guiding every decision from product design to delivery.</p>"
