            "text": "<p>When you choose Samantha Hall Designs, you're not just getting beautifully crafted, pet-inspired stationery; you're supporting a business where impact isn't an afterthought but fundamental to how we operate. </p><p><em>\"We're proud to demonstrate that beautiful, meaningful pet-inspired stationery can be created while respecting and protecting our environment.\"</em> - Samantha Hall, Founder</p>",
