        "heading_NcEFcJ": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>Our reduced plastic guarantee</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_rmfR6a": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We've established a strict reduced-plastic policy throughout our entire operation:</p><ul><li>Custom, durable card packaging made from FSC-certified materials</li><li>Plastic-free shipping with paper tape, cardboard void fill, and compostable mailers</li><li>Natural alternatives for traditionally plastic components</li><li>Zero single-use plastics in the office</li></ul><p>Our products are designed with the planet in mind while delighting our customers, proving that beautiful design and environmental responsibility can go hand-in-hand.</p><p>We are currently exploring plastic-free options for our stickers, so we can be officially plastic-free. </p>"
          }
        },
