        "heading_DWw6qh": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>Helping animal charities raise funds</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_jmfUUB": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Beyond environmental sustainability, we believe in social responsibility. We've established a special partnership with <a href=\"https://www.serbias-forgotten-paws.com/\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Serbia's Forgotten Paws</span></a>, where:</p><ul><li>We donate surplus and sale products to support rescue dogs</li><li>We've created custom Christmas cards specifically for the charity to sell</li><li>This initiative holds special meaning for us as it's where our own rescue dog, Moko, found his forever home</li></ul><p>Through these contributions, we help generate vital funding for animal rescue operations while giving our products a meaningful second life.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
