            "text": "<p>Our business practices align with the UN Sustainable Development Goal 15, focusing on protecting life on land:</p><ul><li>Sourcing raw materials from FSC-managed forests</li><li>Using responsibly sourced cotton for textile products</li><li>Saving energy and reducing waste across operations</li><li>Exploring partnerships with Forestry England to support tree planting</li><li>Working to establish wild areas that encourage biodiversity</li></ul><p>We understand that the wellbeing of pets and wildlife is intrinsically linked to the health of our planet.</p>",
