          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>Circular economy in action</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_9QxWJL": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We're working to close the loop on waste through innovative practices:</p><ul><li>Reusing shipping materials from our suppliers for customer orders</li><li>Donating unsold products to charities for resale</li><li>Ensuring all products can be recycled or repurposed</li><li>Transforming damaged goods into new products</li><li>Providing clear disposal instructions for all packaging</li></ul><p>These circular practices help minimise our environmental footprint while maximising the value of resources.</p>"
          }
        },
