            "heading": "<strong>Reducing our carbon footprint</strong>",
            "text": "<p>We're taking concrete steps to minimise our climate impact:</p><ul><li>Transitioning to an electric van for event transportation</li><li>Consolidating shipments to reduce delivery journeys</li><li>Using renewable energy for our electricity needs</li><li>Implementing a 'switch-off' policy for all equipment</li><li>Exploring carbon offset programs for unavoidable emissions</li><li>Enrolling in Carbon Literacy training to deepen our understanding</li></ul>",
