            "caption": "",
            "heading": "<strong>Our sustainable roadmap</strong>",
            "text": "<p>Our journey doesn't stop here. We're committed to continuous improvement through:</p><ul><li>Setting measurable carbon reduction targets</li><li>Expanding circular economy initiatives</li><li>Researching new eco-friendly materials</li><li>Developing end-of-life programs for our products</li><li>Creating educational content about product care and longevity</li><li>Strengthening our relationship with animal welfare organisations</li></ul>",
